{"id": "34530", "title": "特别待遇", "author": "陈美琳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34530.htm", "intro": "私立玫瑰专科学校最最有名的凸槌女秦悠悠小姐又失业了！说实话，这真的不知道是她第几次「换掉」老闆啦。不能全怪她嘛！谁敢保证工作中不会有些「小小的」状况发生？吉人自有天相，她相信──这、这、这……工作不就从天上掉下来了吗？！没想到她这把十元的麦当劳霜淇淋黏到人家身上，还能捞到一个管家的工作。最重要的一点是──新任老闆年轻又帅劲！可……怎么会有这款代志发生咧？才上任第一天，她的老闆──喔，要叫少爷，就臭着一张脸……不行！不管用啥米方式、方法、手段，她都要「保住」这月薪四万元的工作……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34530", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2190581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2190582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2190583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2190584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2190585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2190586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2190587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2190588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2190589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2190590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2190591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2190592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2190593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2190594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2190595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2190596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2190597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2190598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2190599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2190600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2190601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2190602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2190603.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2190604.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页",